  <result type="3">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Increasing the prospects to ensure accountability for missing persons in the context of Syria</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen existing efforts to find missing and disappeared persons based on the rule of law and promote a secure, impartial, independent data repository that will form the basis of a central record in a future Syria to support accountability and justice for all missing persons by collecting and verifying missing persons data,&#x202F; building the capacity of Syrian civil society organizations, families of the missing, and former detainees to participate in the missing persons process and ensure their voices are heard and strengthening the capacity of first responders to safeguard missing persons data and sites of forensic interest.</narrative>
   </description>
